{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ebf6ef8d9735e2b1","name":"Dual Gear","source":{"id":"source:reference-ebf6ef8d9735e2b1","title":"Dual Gear","revision":19646,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:20:52Z","sha256":"daa13f4a66c6e569cf488b14d325087994f6b0f80ad281486a6465ddad800c72","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19646","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Dual%20Gear&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ebf6ef8d9735e2b1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," can be built into another as an Upgrade, but it is impossible to place a larger piece of gear into a smaller piece- you can't cram a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:ae1584087cb7657b"}," into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". Dual Gear can act as either piece of component gear without penalty. For example, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Glow Rod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Glow_Rod","referenceId":"reference:1c8b9eaebeec7318"}," that has been Upgraded to include a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hold-Out Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hold-Out_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:99ddc9f0285574f3"}," can illuminate or shoot, as the user desires. Normally, such ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," can't act as both pieces of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," at once.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You must pay the full price for the piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," being added to the primary object as Dual Gear. If either piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," or other energy source, it must have its own (items combined with this modification cannot share ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Packs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Packs"}," or other energy sources).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
